### Sample requests for the Trivia Battle server.
### Open in Visual Studio, or VS Code with the "REST Client" extension, and click "Send Request".

@host = http://localhost:5000

### Categories available at the kiosk
GET {{host}}/api/categories

### Start a free-for-all match
POST {{host}}/api/matches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "FreeForAll",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "difficulty": "Easy",
  "seats": [
    { "stationId": "A1", "playerName": "Ann" },
    { "stationId": "A2", "playerName": "Bob" },
    { "stationId": "A3", "playerName": "Cat" },
    { "stationId": "A4", "playerName": "Dan" }
  ],
  "teams": []
}

### Start a 2v2 Group match (teams can be any stations)
POST {{host}}/api/matches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "TeamSharedAnswer",
  "categoryId": 2,
  "difficulty": "Medium",
  "seats": [
    { "stationId": "A1", "playerName": "Ann" },
    { "stationId": "A2", "playerName": "Bob" },
    { "stationId": "A3", "playerName": "Cat" },
    { "stationId": "A4", "playerName": "Dan" }
  ],
  "teams": [
    { "teamId": "red", "name": "Red", "stationIds": ["A1", "A4"] },
    { "teamId": "blue", "name": "Blue", "stationIds": ["A2", "A3"] }
  ]
}

### All running matches (admin view, includes correct answers)
GET {{host}}/api/matches

### Press a button (dev only). 10-13 = Player 1 A-D, 14-17 = Player 2, 18-21 = Player 3, 22-25 = Player 4
POST {{host}}/api/dev/buttons/10

### Abort a match (replace the id)
POST {{host}}/api/matches/MATCH_ID/abort
